Short:        C++ Library (intuition,exec,..)
Author:       armin@uni-paderborn.de (Armin Vogt)
Uploader:     armin uni-paderborn de (Armin Vogt)
Type:         dev/c
Version:      1.10
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

This is the NEW version 1.10 by Aug, 30, 1994 of A++ Library.

A++ is not only a wrapper library but recollects system functions to powerful
objects that support programming the Amiga (i.e. automatically re-sizable gadgets, object attribute constraints, ...).

This archive contains the FULL SOURCE and support for compiling it with
SAS/C++ AND GNU/C++. 
No binaries in this archive. Executables and the A++ link library for SAS
can be found in APPSAS_bin.lha. The link library for GNU can be found in
APPGNU_bin.lha.

This archive expands to a new directory 'APlusPlus' in the current work
directory.
